{"version":1,"content":"<p>eBay發言人證實，該公司將裁減約9%的員工，此舉旨在精簡運營並聚焦於增長最快的領域。此次裁員將影響約1000名員工。該發言人在一份聲明中表示：「在我們努力把握未來的重大機遇之際，我們採取了這一舉措，通過讓團隊和資源與我們最高戰略優先級保持一致，確保我們繼續以強勢地位運營。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583256.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:44.781865+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T15:55:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"eb09262971e66ab967df2903f58a4b7aec1313942d009d6837a4f26621c5d7a7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}